  "plain": "In 2025 someone from the Disclosure Project, a group run by the UFO activist Steven Greer that gathers people willing to speak out about government secrets, reached out to Dan Sherman and offered him legal protection as a whistleblower if he would testify. Sherman, a former Air Force sergeant who says the National Security Agency, the US spy agency that intercepts communications, hired him to talk with aliens, tells this himself. \"Not Steven Greer himself, but somebody else now,\" he says, adding that he and Greer had talked long ago. If true, he was being asked to tell his story officially, with protection."
